      "content": "i know you arent a doctor but i just need some quick info. i have asthma but it's pretty well controlled with my inhaler, so i dont think it'll be an issue. i just really need to stop the shaking for tomorrow. is it generally considered safe for people with mild asthma to take a low dose of a beta blocker for anxiety?",
